---
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---

<LegalPage
  title="Privacy notice · SpotAI"
  description="What the SpotAI website collects when you browse it or join the waitlist: Google Analytics, Microsoft Clarity, a first-party visit counter, cookies, EmailJS, future advertising, and how to ask for deletion."
  heading="Privacy notice"
>
  <p class="lead">This notice covers this website only (spotai.streamerosai.com). What the SpotAI app does with your data is explained in the app's privacy centre.</p>

  <h2>What the waitlist form collects</h2>
  <p>
    When you join the waitlist, I receive what you type: your name, WhatsApp number, gym name and whether you are a member or
    an owner, plus the page you sent it from. The form sends it by email using EmailJS, to {SITE.email}. EmailJS processes the
    message in transit.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics and cookies</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Google Analytics.</strong> Sets first-party cookies and sends usage data to Google: pages viewed, approximate location, device and browser, and the source of the visit.</li>
    <li><strong>Microsoft Clarity.</strong> A free tool that records anonymised heatmaps and session replays so I can see where visitors get stuck. Text typed into the waitlist form is masked and is not recorded.</li>
    <li><strong>First-party visit counter.</strong> A small script from my own Cloudflare Worker (pulse.yaseenyk.workers.dev) counts page views and tells human visits from bots. It sets no cookie and stores no IP address, no user-agent string and no text you type. It switches itself off if your browser sends Do Not Track or Global Privacy Control, and records are deleted after 90 days.</li>
    <li><strong>Hosting.</strong> The site is served by GitHub Pages, which may log requests such as IP addresses under its own policy.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>None of this is used to target you with advertising. You can block it with a browser extension or by turning off cookies.</p>

  <h2>Advertising in future</h2>
  <p>
    No ads run on this site today. If I turn on Google AdSense later, Google and its partners may use cookies to show ads and to
    personalise them. You will be able to opt out of personalised advertising at
    <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener">adssettings.google.com</a> or
    <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" rel="noopener">aboutads.info</a>, and this notice will be updated before ads appear.
  </p>

  <h2>The demo app</h2>
  <p>The offline demo of the member app saves what you enter on your own phone. It is not sent to me.</p>

  <h2>What I use it for</h2>
  <p>Only to reply to you about SpotAI and to understand which pages help gym owners and members. I do not sell or share your details.</p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    To see, correct or delete what you sent, email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> from the contact details you
    used. See also the <a href="/terms/">terms of use</a>.
  </p>
  <p class="priv__date">Last updated 16 November 2026.</p>
</LegalPage>
